    <string name="referral_faqs_title">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_collapse_desc">Collapse</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_expand_desc">Expand</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q1">How do referrals work?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a1">Share your referral link with friends. When they install Pyllar, complete setup, start a daily SIP, and earn the 7-day streak badge, you earn 100 coins.</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q2">Does my friend need to enter a referral code?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a2">No. Your referral code is automatically attached to the shared link, so your friend just needs to install the app using your link.</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q3">What is the 7-day streak badge?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a3">Your friend earns the 7-day streak badge after completing investments for 7 days in a row. If they pause, cancel, or miss an investment, the streak resets and starts over.</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q4">When will I receive my referral reward?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a4">You’ll receive 100 coins instantly once your friend completes 7 successful investment days.</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q5">How do I use or withdraw my coins?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a5">Coins are added to your Pyllar wallet. 1 coin = ₹1, and they can be redeemed according to wallet redemption rules.</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_q6">Is there a limit to how many friends I can invite?</string>
    <string name="referral_faq_a6">No. You can invite as many friends as you want and earn rewards for each eligible referral.</string>
